Copyright 2026 keelo12345

This project includes firmware derived from or inspired by Enactic, Inc.'s
openarm_ker_firmware (https://docs.openarm.dev/), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

The encoder firmware in firmware/encoder/ originates from that project;
original copyright headers and the Apache 2.0 license (LICENSE.txt) are
retained. main.cpp.test is a modified version of the original firmware.
main.cpp.benchdiag is a new diagnostic firmware written for the same
hardware, reusing the original pin assignments and TLE5012B SSC access
sequence.

Structural CAD files in cad/ are re-designed parts based on the OpenArm
KER open-source hardware design.
